m?t=1745797195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/4de51dc4d29ff235feebf8faa0b45ad7.mp4?t=1745797195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Declare <i>War</i> on Bubbles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Click, strategize, explore, and ascend \u2014 the bubble realm awaits your feline army!</strong></i></u></p>",
